This patch handles case where raid hidden components
were not being removed when power turned off to device
attached to expander.  This also handle the case when
exposing raid components when power was turned back on
to devices attached to an expander.  These are urgent
bug fixes.

JEJB: Pls apply to scsi-rc-fixes tree.

Signed-off-by: Eric Moore <Eric.Moore@lsil.com>

